Add the ADID, patch and patch-table firmware files used by the btaic
driver, and the SDIO Wi-Fi firmware used by the aic driver, for the
AIC8800D80 U02 chipset. Store all four files under aic/aic8800d80/.

All four firmware files are version v6.9.1.1 and are provided under
LICENSES/LICENSE.aic.

The Bluetooth and Wi-Fi driver sources have already been submitted
upstream as RFC patch series. Both are currently being revised in
response to review feedback.

This submission introduces a new vendor license text in
LICENSES/LICENSE.aic and requests explicit maintainer review.

